<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 249-7 IN 50 OVERS V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 249-7 IN 50 OVERS V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe scored 249 for seven off</p>
<p>their 50 overs in the third and final one day international</p>
<p>against</p>
<p>England at Harare Sports Club on Friday.</p>
</text>
